					"nextDialogs": [
						205160503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205160503,
					"content": "哇！吓我一跳，你是从哪冒出来的，怎么找到我的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160504,
					"content": "我还以为，没人能找到这个地方呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160505,
					"content": "啊，对了，一定是葛瑞丝修女告诉你的吧，她一直在这附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160506,
					"content": "之前我吃的药，也有很多是她送过来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160507,
					"content": "葛瑞丝修女真是个好人哪，不过我可不想一直呆在蒙德城…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205160508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 205160508,
					"content": "好啦，我知道哥哥在找我，等会我就会回去啦。不会让哥哥担心的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安娜"
